Abstract: The <{model}> element allows embedding 3D graphical content inline within an [[HTML]] document to be managed declaratively, and rendered directly by the user agent. The {{HTMLModelElement}} interface then provides a simple API for controlling the presentation, animation, interaction, fetching, and UI affordances of a <{model}>.
